  "content_en": "Dahan Yanhua About About Lingdian Academy 1: About eunuchs In fact, compared to eunuchs, the name of palace maid sounds much better. Distant eyes. Okay, the above is just a joke. I just want to ensure that this book will never be eunuch. Starting from November 2008, I worked hard to save manuscripts for three months. As of the publication date, I had a total of 330,000 manuscripts in hand. Three hundred and thirty thousand. This is a number that I never dared to think of before. Saving manuscripts has never been unfamiliar to me. I seem like the kind of squandering nouveau riche who has some spare money and just wants to spend it. This time I have calmed down and saved the manuscript for so long. In fact, I was afraid that something would happen to me and hurt the hearts of readers. Now, I can finally say with my head held high that this book will never be abandoned. 330,000. If you update it every day, you can update it for several months, right? In the past few months, I have been working hard and slowly, and I will definitely not have any problems again. So unless there are force majeure factors (such as earthquakes, tsunamis, city-wide blackouts), I have no choice. During the update period of this book, I will definitely update it at least once a day. If I need to go out, I will leave it to the editor. Ah, I feel so happy as a nouveau riche. 2: Regarding fairy tales, this book returns to the style I am good at, reconstructing history, and writing a fairy tale in the true historical background. From the day I learned about Empress Xiaohui Zhang, I have always felt pity for this woman. Therefore, I hope that I can rewrite a fairy tale and let her live a happy life in this fairy tale. In a certain sense, every romance novel is a fairy tale. People who read novels are all looking for fairy tales. In reality, there are always stumbling blocks, so in the novel, you can feel great sadness and joy, laugh at your own smile, and shed your own tears. Therefore, this novel is still cloaked in history and written with my own romance. Romance is about love: love, family, friendship, three beautiful emotions. In this novel, the world is divided into three parts, and the country is divided into three parts. See which one touches you the most. I don’t necessarily believe in fairy tales. But I believe in the truth, goodness and beauty in human nature. The only fairy tale I don't believe in is love at first sight. I only believe in love at first sight. Every relationship has its own context, and it is my true intention to carefully trace this context. People wandering around in the mortal world will not love because of love. If the flower of love is not cared for by those who love it, it will not bear beautiful fruits. No one can be a lover, and they will be lonely for love for no reason all their lives. Taste the true meaning of love, there is bitterness and sweetness, whirling is joy. A joyful fairy tale. Three: About the protagonist, about Zhang Yan, about Emperor Hui of the Han Dynasty, about...about everything about the protagonists of this story. I like them very much. I like Zhang Yan, the queen of Xiaohui who lived a beautiful and lonely life in history, and I like how historians commented on Emperor Xiaohui who was weak but had a kind heart. Not to be pretentious, I really like them. But I love my characters Zhang Yan and Liu Ying. Once a writer devotes himself to his characters, they develop their own emotions and develop their own stories. Those characters who wandered and disappeared in Zhang’s history in my story are no longer who they were in history, at least not completely. So don’t look at it from a historical perspective. I cannot bear the responsibility of spoiling children’s view of history. In my heart, they have a more passionate love and a more innocent feeling. They're not perfect, but I want them to be real. I can't write it perfectly, because no gold is pure and no one is perfect. There is no real perfection in the world except perfection itself. But I have a very lofty wish, that is, when this story ends, my pen can make you feel that such a woman is a wife that a man can consider taking home. Such a man is someone a girl would agree to marry. Four: Regarding the early Han Dynasty, I reported the characters I wanted to write about. My editor Xiaoxiao Tongxiao was silent for a while and said, \"You really love the early Han Dynasty.\" I said at that time that it was because I had checked too much information and it was not a waste to write about it. Thinking about it later, yes. I love the early Han Dynasty very much. It is not so old that the thatched house with bronze oracle bones makes me feel deserted and strange, and it is not so close that the blue and white porcelain and yellow pear wood bed is like opening the door and you can reach the late Qing Dynasty next door. It inherits the ancient and clear folk customs brought down from the pre-Qin Dynasty, and it inherits the prosperity of the Han people for two thousand years. It is clear, it sings the ancient \"Book of Songs\", and the green woman comes out of the Qin wind. It is soft and charming, and the style of Chu's waist is folded. Chu's songs are all over the world, and crimson clothes are popular. If we compare a person's life, it is the young age, just like the time when Zhang Yan was born, with the name of pink and tender snow dumplings, not as ignorant as a baby.Such endless crying is boring, and it will not be tainted by the sophistication. Like the beauties on the Qinhuai River, beauty is beautiful, and it is not tainted by the dust of the world. During the five thousand years of China, there were two most glorious eras, one as graceful as the Tang Dynasty and one as clean and healthy as the early Han Dynasty. The beauty and elegance of the prosperous Tang Dynasty is not bad, but I always like the thin, wide-sleeved Hanfu. It has countless towering and dignified high-rise buildings, and there are also many beautiful generals and beauties walking out of the palace. In its era, countless unspoken rules that are deeply detestable for later Chinese generations have not yet been established. A slave knight can be a general, and a singing girl can be a queen (of course, if the deposed queen is not my family's favorite Gillian, I will love it more.) Of course, the least and least, is the eyes staring in the wind and smoke, and the sincere love. [Mo, I always feel that I have read this last sentence somewhere.] I wrote it out of love. Five: Regarding the tragic and joyful day, when the editor Liuli finally married off my eldest daughter, he sighed with a tearful face and said to me, the publication recommendation I wrote for you is: the most sadistic palace novel of the year... something like that, I can't remember clearly. I remember that I was very surprised and asked her, \"Where is the abuse in my book?\" She was very angry (expression), why is it not abuse? Great abuse article. Speechless. My original intention was obviously to write a sweet and endearing story. Why the abuse? The broken mirror is reunited, the man chases the woman, stays together until old age, lives and sleeps together, and dies in the same hole. No matter how you look at it, it is a harmonious and beautiful reunion. I am the most soft-hearted, and I am not willing to torment my daughter. ...Okay, I admit it, I am the \"genius\" who can write a happy ending that makes people feel heartbroken. This book adheres to the consistent style, with a complete life, various emotions, ups and downs, clear and sweet. I won’t let you come to me crying and tell me that I want them to be together. If you are upset, I must say, this is obviously a comedy. One day, I asked a friend in a very confusing way: Why do people always say that I am abusive, even though I write warm and romantic novels? A friend asked me, what is your understanding of warmth. I say, it’s the warmth of interaction in the details, and the warmth that shines through in adversity. She said angrily, \"You said it was adversity, why don't you abuse me?\" She held her head. Six: Regarding good and bad people. If you give me enough space, I can find a reason to defend everyone who has done bad things (or bad things). Hateful people must be pitiful. There are no pure bad people in the world. Seven: About \"The Hate in the Golden House\", which I started writing in May 2007, is my first novel. The manuscript was completed in October 2007, and the physical book will be released in October 2008. You can purchase it on Taobao, Dangdang, and Excellence. We continue to advertise here, 50% off, 50% off, Dangdang is running a special offer, a set of books for 44 yuan is now only selling for 22 yuan, so don’t miss it if you pass by. Also free shipping. Eight: About the love-hate second daughter in \"Mo Xiang\". repent. I don't know what to do with you at the moment. Let's start over again, clean up the old mountains and rivers, and face the sky! 9: Regarding PK, this book was PKed in February 2009. I am not very confident at the moment. tear. Please support me and reserve your pink ticket. Don’t miss it if you’re passing by. It’s a popular place if you have a ticket, but a big hit if you don’t have a ticket. 10: About the New Year On the occasion of the New Year, I wish you all a happy New Year and good luck to the cattle and sheep. To celebrate the New Year, there will be five updates tomorrow. The first update will be around midnight tonight. The second update depends on when you get up tomorrow morning. From 9am to 12pm. Please recommend new books for collection. Silently, on the first day, at this moment, the new book collection is in the pitiful double digits, and I am really not used to it. Eleven: About about like the title.",
  "translated": true
